{"name":"树形控件","description":"把文件夹、部门或分类按父子关系排列，并让用户逐层展开或收起 · 例如项目文件会显示“src”文件夹，展开后才能看到里面的页面文件。它主要帮助浏览层级；需要从中勾选并提交结果时，应使用 树选择 Tree Select 。","quote":"文件夹那种一层层展开的，点小三角展开下一级。","agentPrompt":"请把项目文件区做成树形浏览：文件夹可展开收起，文件不可展开，缩进和图标要能区分层级，并保留当前展开状态。测试深层目录、同名文件、键盘导航和窄屏缩进。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-tree\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>树形控件<span>Tree</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">文件夹那种一层层展开的，点小三角展开下一级。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">把文件夹、部门或分类按父子关系排列，并让用户逐层展开或收起</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>例如项目文件会显示“src”文件夹，展开后才能看到里面的页面文件。它主要帮助浏览层级；需要从中勾选并提交结果时，应使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/tree-select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"tree-select\" aria-label=\"树选择 Tree Select\">树选择 <b>Tree Select</b></a>。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"tre-live\"><div class=\"tre-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"tre1\" checked><label class=\"tre-node\" for=\"tre1\"><span class=\"tre-arrow\">▸</span><span class=\"tre-label on\">设计部</span></label><div class=\"tre-kids\"><div class=\"tre-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"tre2\"><label class=\"tre-node\" for=\"tre2\"><span class=\"tre-arrow\">▸</span><span class=\"tre-label\">UI 组</span></label><div class=\"tre-kids\"><div class=\"tre-leaf\"><span class=\"tre-arrow\"></span><span class=\"tre-label\">林小hu</span></div><div class=\"tre-leaf\"><span class=\"tre-arrow\"></span><span class=\"tre-label\">ans-studio</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tre-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"tre3\"><label class=\"tre-node\" for=\"tre3\"><span class=\"tre-arrow\">▸</span><span class=\"tre-label\">用研组</span></label><div class=\"tre-kids\"><div class=\"tre-leaf\"><span class=\"tre-arrow\"></span><span class=\"tre-label\">阿麦</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tre-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"tre4\"><label class=\"tre-node\" for=\"tre4\"><span class=\"tre-arrow\">▸</span><span class=\"tre-label\">研发部</span></label><div class=\"tre-kids\"><div class=\"tre-leaf\"><span class=\"tre-arrow\"></span><span class=\"tre-label\">前端组</span></div><div class=\"tre-leaf\"><span class=\"tre-arrow\"></span><span class=\"tre-label\">后端组</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把项目文件区做成树形浏览：文件夹可展开收起，文件不可展开，缩进和图标要能区分层级，并保留当前展开状态。测试深层目录、同名文件、键盘导航和窄屏缩进。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">数据<b>天生有层级</b>：文件夹、分类、菜单</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:0px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">▾</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">📁 设计资源</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:12px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">📄 首页.sketch</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:12px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">📄 图标.sketch</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:0px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">▸</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">📁 素材库</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">存在<b>多层父子关系</b>，需要逐级展开查看</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:0px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">▾</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">一级分类</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:12px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">▾</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">二级分类</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:24px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">▾</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">三级分类</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:36px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">叶子节点</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>组织架构</b>选人：公司 → 部门 → 成员</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:0px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">▾</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">🏢 某某科技</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:12px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">▾</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">设计部</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:24px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">林小hu</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:4px;width:100%;padding-left:12px\"><span style=\"width:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3);flex:none\">▸</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;co